{"id":"b88a6e29130bb688","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pbpolynomialextrema.md","title":"Exact extrema of the polynomial extension","display":"thm-pbpolynomialextrema — Exact extrema of the polynomial extension","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pbpolynomialextrema","aliases":["27-thm-pbpolynomialextrema"],"display":"thm-pbpolynomialextrema — Exact extrema of the polynomial extension","depends_on":["[[27-thm-pbexpectation]]","[[27-df-pbopt]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.4.3","source_statement":"Theorem 13.12 and its expectation argument","source_printed_pages":"588–589","source_pdf_pages":"612–613","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pbpolynomialextrema"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pbpolynomialextrema</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pbpolynomialextrema — Exact extrema of the polynomial extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f22777763c64bcce\" href=\"?note=f22777763c64bcce\" title=\"27-thm-pbexpectation\">27-thm-pbexpectation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a668791f62b82e2a\" href=\"?note=a668791f62b82e2a\" title=\"27-df-pbopt\">27-df-pbopt</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.4.3"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Theorem 13.12 and its expectation argument"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"588–589"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"612–613"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n,\\mathrm{PolExt},\\beta_p\">\\(U_n,\\mathrm{PolExt},\\beta_p\\)</span> 及其期望公式（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f22777763c64bcce\" href=\"?note=f22777763c64bcce\" title=\"27-thm-pbexpectation\">27-thm-pbexpectation</a>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBArgmin},\\mathrm{PBArgmax}\">\\(\\mathrm{PBArgmin},\\mathrm{PBArgmax}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a668791f62b82e2a\" href=\"?note=a668791f62b82e2a\" title=\"27-df-pbopt\">27-df-pbopt</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad\\min_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a)\\leq\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)\\leq\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad\\min_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a)\\leq\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)\\leq\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\min_{p\\in U_n}\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)=\\min_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a),\\qquad\\max_{p\\in U_n}\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)=\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\min_{p\\in U_n}\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)=\\min_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a),\\qquad\\max_{p\\in U_n}\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)=\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad\\left(\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)=\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n:\\beta_p(a)&gt;0\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{PBArgmax}(f)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad\\left(\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)=\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n:\\beta_p(a)&gt;0\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{PBArgmax}(f)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 13.12 给出最大值等式；印588/PDF612 的逐坐标舍入证明与期望证明均已核对。最小值由对 −f 应用同一结论得到；最后一式为本地补充：非负权重的平均达到最大值，当且仅当每个正权重点均达最大值。顶点保证两端取到，因此没有对任意 BoxExt 随意使用不存在的极值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-thm-pbexpectation","status":"resolved","id":"f22777763c64bcce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbexpectation]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbopt","status":"resolved","id":"a668791f62b82e2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbopt]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-pbexpectation","status":"resolved","id":"f22777763c64bcce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$U_n,\\mathrm{PolExt},\\beta_p$ 及其期望公式（see [[27-thm-pbexpectation]]）；$\\mathrm{PBArgmin},\\mathrm{PBArgmax}$（see [[27-df-pbopt]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbopt","status":"resolved","id":"a668791f62b82e2a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$U_n,\\mathrm{PolExt},\\beta_p$ 及其期望公式（see [[27-thm-pbexpectation]]）；$\\mathrm{PBArgmin},\\mathrm{PBArgmax}$（see [[27-df-pbopt]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"U_n,\\mathrm{PolExt},\\beta_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBArgmin},\\mathrm{PBArgmax}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad\\min_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a)\\leq\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)\\leq\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a).","display":true},{"tex":"\\min_{p\\in U_n}\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)=\\min_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a),\\qquad\\max_{p\\in U_n}\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)=\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad\\left(\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)=\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n:\\beta_p(a)>0\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{PBArgmax}(f)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1881,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-499","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbpolynomialextrema|thm-pbpolynomialextrema — Exact extrema of the polynomial extension]]"}],"outgoing":["f22777763c64bcce","a668791f62b82e2a"]}